&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance is a leading global blockchain ecosystem behind the world’s largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume and registered users. We are trusted by 300+ million people in 100+ countries for our industry-leading security, user fund transparency, trading engine speed, deep liquidity, and an unmatched portfolio of digital-asset products. Binance offerings range from trading and finance to education, research, payments, institutional services, and more. Our mission is to increase the freedom of money and financial access for people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join Binance&#39;s Customer Service team and be a part of a client-facing business function where exceptional support is our priority. We aim to create a platform where users receive top-quality assistance with fast response times and accurate information. Our support is provided via ticketing systems and live chat, handling customer queries, complaints, and identification approval processes for our world-class cryptocurrency exchange platform. We seek empathetic, communicative, and problem-solving individuals who can advocate for our customers and gather valuable feedback. Join us and help ensure exceptional service standards and high customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle back office tickets, and provide 7*24h online enquiry and email reply services to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer enquiries, advice and suggestions via email or online tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other business units with customer liaison, accurately document customer requests and advice, and provide feedback in the form of documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer complaints, special cases or ad hoc tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requirements:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Service experience is not required, however can be beneficial if candidate has previous financial industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;College degree or above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trilingual speaker with native Spanish, advanced English and one more language will be preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of honesty and integrity; Proactive and meticulous; A sense of responsibility and team work spirit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure, strong communication skills and exceed beyond expectation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate for customer service industry and can accept to work under different work shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about the crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Binance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of finance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with world-class talent in a user-centric global organization with a flat structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle challenging projects in a fast-paced and innovative enviornment with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a results-driven workplace with opportunities for career growth and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and company benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first, work-from-home arrangement (may vary depending on the nature of the role and team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binance is committed to being an equal opportunity employer. We believe that having a diverse workforce is fundamental to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting a job application, you acknowledge that you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.binance.com/en/candidate/privacy/notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, or assessing responses and identifying potential inconsistencies or verification signals in application materials based on available information. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans. If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please contact us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, while we are a remote-first company, you may be asked to report in person on an ad-hoc basis for team gatherings, functional off-sites or customer meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Billing Operations Analyst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio is looking for a talented and results driven person who is passionate about work, savvy about billing and pricing from the business view not only financial and who lives&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/values&quot;&gt; the Twilio Magic&lt;/a&gt; They also have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding communication skills, both written and verbal, and ability to advocate for a position while maintaining a collaborative, and open-minded approach. You should be someone who is a champion of streamlining processes and sees projects through to completion. We are looking for someone who enjoys and thrives in a fast-paced environment, with zealous attention to detail, good judgment, and is dedicated to providing excellent customer service.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Revenue Team external customer email, responding to customer and other external queries in a timely manner and onboard customers to Twilio’s internal billing system and Financial ERP system, Gather and format large raw data sets to assist with customer billing reporting and queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in month end close, including: Managing and tracking recurring billing and managing approvals, tracking and application of customer credits. Analysis of revenue related balance sheet accounts, Ad hoc customer financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist and participate in the development and implementation of financial controls and process surrounding revenue and invoicing, Onboard customers to Twilio’s internal billing system and Financial ERP system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in external and internal audits, as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve queries customers are facing relating to their billing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently investigate customer issues, searching internal resources, previous cases, Slack channels etc to understand issues and provide detailed analysis of customer issues to the Sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manipulate and analyze large datasets in Excel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to the Sales team in a timely manner and communicate complicated issues via Slack, via SFDC, via calls. Excellent communication skills are required - occasional calls with customers or Senior Leaders may be required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work under pressure - high paced environment, quick turnaround times in order to comply with team SLA’s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other teams in order to solve root problems to customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help out on other teams within the Billing Ops group, as requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Month End close, as requested.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in the area of Billings / Revenue / Order to Cash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated problem-solving, strong interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Oracle, Zuora and Salesforce is advantageous, although not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience working with large volume transactions with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel user: able to handle very large raw data sets using pivots and other functions such as VLOOKUPS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years experience in an Operations role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Periodic weekend work will also be essential for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Third level qualification in Accountancy, Finance or a Business related discipline or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient Spanish and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote, and based in&amp;nbsp; Mexico City Mexico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We prioritize connection and opportunities to build relationships with our customers and each other. For this role, you may be required to travel occasionally to participate in project or team in-person meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&g

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, while we are a remote-first company, you may be asked to report in person on an ad-hoc basis for team gatherings, functional off-sites or customer meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Product Operation Specialist 1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio is seeking a Product Operations Specialist I to support our Porting and Hosting Operations—a key component of Twilio’s Global Number Management team. This role ensures customers can seamlessly port phone numbers, manage number hosting, and experience reliable service during transitions. You’ll work across carrier networks, internal tools, and product teams to troubleshoot, coordinate, and optimize porting workflows at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Level 1 role is an entry-level position ideal for someone who is detail-oriented, process-driven, with excelsior customer servicing skills and excited to work at the intersection of product, operations, and telecom. This position plays a vital role in ensuring Twilio’s phone number experience remains best-in-class.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wear the Customer’s Shoes&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the customer experience by managing inbound porting requests with care, urgency, and accuracy. Ensure customers have a seamless transition when bringing their phone numbers to Twilio or managing hosted services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with a diverse team of engineers, support agents, product managers, and carrier partners. Respect different communication styles, cultures, and perspectives while driving unified outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower Others&lt;/strong&gt;: Proactively share insights, documentation, and solutions with peers and partner teams to make operational processes easier and more transparent. Help elevate the broader team by contributing to best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write It Down&lt;/strong&gt;: Maintain accurate records of porting workflows, number hosting cases, escalations, and system usage. Keep internal knowledge bases and documentation up to date to ensure reliability and consistency across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Shenanigans&lt;/strong&gt;: Follow industry and regulatory standards in number portability and telecom compliance. Protect customer data and make ethical decisions when managing sensitive porting and routing scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Bold&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative in solving problems and navigating complexity, even when documentation is limited. Don’t hesitate to raise questions, propose improvements, or flag issues that impact the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Draw the Owl&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify recurring issues and inefficiencies in porting and hosting operations. Use your findings to improve workflows, tooling, or automation — even when there’s no clear roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t Settle&lt;/strong&gt;: Aim to exceed SLAs and continuously look for ways to optimize how we execute core operations. Be relentless about quality, efficiency, and learning from mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years of experience in BPO, customer campaigns, tech support, customer operations, product operations, customer service, QA or other related areas of customer service like inventory, finance, quality operations, customer support, customer or team training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual: Spanish and English proficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage detailed processes with accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic data analysis (Excel/Google Sheets, SQL), or automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic AI prompting and workflow building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication, both internally and with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with tools like ticketing systems (Excel, Zendesk, JIRA), spreadsheets, and internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to learn quickly, adapt to changing processes, and work independently while collaborating cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric mindset with strong attention to detail and a proactive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with telecom Industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&g

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a global data and AI consulting firm. We help organisations turn data and AI into measurable business impact across the value chain, from strategy and operating model to data platforms, AI products and marketing. More than 2,500 consultants, data scientists and engineers work for over 1,000 clients worldwide, including Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Switzerland, our team of around 50 people works from Zurich and Lausanne with Swiss and international companies. Our work covers AI strategy and governance, data transformation and AI use cases that run in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing: Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Partner to take over and grow Artefact’s commercial business in Lausanne. The office already serves clients across Romandie, and its Tech chapter is led by a Partner on site. You will take over an established client portfolio and grow it against ambitious targets: deepen existing relationships, win new accounts in industry, retail and luxury, and grow the team that delivers them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking over existing client relationships in Romandie through a structured handover, and growing them into broader, multi-year partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opening new accounts with business leaders (CEO, COO, CMO, Chief Digital Officer, heads of business units) at industrial, retail, consumer and luxury companies in Romandie, and at the regional headquarters of international groups around Lake Geneva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing Artefact’s Lausanne office with the Swiss Managing Partner and our Lausanne Tech Partner: more clients, more revenue and a larger team. You will also strengthen Artefact’s visibility in the French-speaking business and academic ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading client executives through data and AI transformation, so that Artefact becomes their partner of choice for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Partner, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the Romandie client portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run an account and go-to-market plan for Romandie: growth targets for existing clients, new target accounts and entry offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your pipeline and report on it monthly: qualified opportunities, conversion rate, sold revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write proposals that address the client’s actual problem, own scoping and pricing, and shape them with the Tech chapter so that strategy and implementation come as one offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand existing accounts to more buyers and business units per client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver to the highest standard&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sponsor engagements run day to day by Engagement Managers, with multidisciplinary teams of consultants, data scientists and data/AI engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for client satisfaction, project margin and team experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our knowledge base&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a sector edge in industry, retail or luxury: where data and AI change margins, operations or customer experience, and how to package that into offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak and publish in French and English on data and AI topics relevant to these sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Artefact’s global industry practices to bring their assets and references to Swiss clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Lausanne team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the Lausanne team with Swiss leadership through hiring and internal development, and own staffing on your engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach consultants on client handling, problem solving and sector knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15 years of experience, mostly in consulting: technology consulting, strategy consulting, transaction services/due diligence, or a large consulting and technology services firm. A move in-house after a consulting career is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently Director, Principal or Associate Partner with a personal sales target, ready for the step to Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of growing client relationships: you can name accounts you expanded and the revenue you sold, including clients you opened yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sector experience in industrial goods, retail, consumer or luxury, and a network among decision-makers in Romandie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French at native or full professional level, and fluent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in data and AI: you can discuss what an AI use case needs from data, what it costs and when it pays back, without being an engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the Lausanne area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape what comes next: the Swiss practice has proven itself and is growing fast. It is still small enough that you shape its clients, its offers and its team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell with a global platform: you bring the credentials, delivery capacity and AI assets of a 2,500-person firm into every proposal, and you work with industry leads across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy to production under one roof: our consultants and engineers work in the same teams, so your clients get from recommendation to working solution without changing firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture: innovation, collaboration and action shape how we work. Artefact Switzerland is Great Place to Work certified (2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: you are measured on the clients, revenue and team you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a global data and AI consulting firm. We help organisations turn data and AI into measurable business impact across the value chain, from strategy and operating model to data platforms, AI products and marketing. More than 2,500 consultants, data scientists and engineers work for over 1,000 clients worldwide, including Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Switzerland, our team of around 50 people works from Zurich and Lausanne with Swiss and international companies. Our work covers AI strategy and governance, data transformation and AI use cases that run in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing: Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Partner to scale Artefact’s Pharma &amp;amp; Life Sciences practice in Switzerland. Many global pharma, biotech and medtech companies run their headquarters, R&amp;amp;D, manufacturing or commercial functions from Switzerland. We already work with life sciences clients here and now want to make this practice one of the pillars of our Swiss business. This is an origination role: most of your time goes into winning new clients and expanding existing relationships. You will be based in Zurich and work with clients across Basel, Zurich and Romandie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling the Swiss Life Sciences practice: its offer, its client base and its team, in coordination with Artefact’s global healthcare and life sciences teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing existing client relationships and winning new clients, so that the practice moves from first references to a broad portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading senior client stakeholders (CDO/CDAO, CIO, heads of Commercial Excellence, Medical Affairs, R&amp;amp;D Operations, Manufacturing &amp;amp; Quality) through data and AI transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing project delivery and quality assurance on our life sciences engagements, and giving strategic support to ongoing client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sparring with the Swiss Managing Partner on practice strategy and investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Partner, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the practice and its offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on our existing life sciences work to define where data and AI create value along the pharma value chain: R&amp;amp;D and clinical development, regulatory and medical affairs, manufacturing and quality, supply chain, and commercial engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate this into a few Swiss offers with clear entry points, scope and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the client portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a go-to-market plan for Swiss life sciences, own the pipeline and write proposals that address the client’s actual problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate pharma procurement: vendor qualification, framework agreements and preferred-supplier panels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver to the highest standard&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sponsor and oversee engagements run day to day by Engagement Managers, with multidisciplinary teams of consultants, data scientists and data/AI engineers, and ensure the quality of what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure delivery meets regulatory requirements: GxP, validation of AI systems, Swiss FADP/GDPR and the EU AI Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for client satisfaction, project margin and team experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our knowledge base&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak and publish on AI in life sciences, for example GenAI in medical and regulatory writing, AI in clinical operations, HCP engagement, and AI governance under GxP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn our Swiss life sciences work into references and case studies, and bring them into Artefact’s global practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop consultants with life sciences experience, train the wider Swiss team on the domain, and own staffing on your engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15 years of experience, including 8+ years serving pharma, biotech or medtech clients at a life sciences–focused consultancy or the life sciences practice of a strategy or technology firm. A later move in-house is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently Director, Principal or Associate Partner with a personal sales target, ready for the step to Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of origination with life sciences clients: you can name clients you opened yourself and the revenue you sold, beyond extending existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A network among decision-makers in the Swiss life sciences industry, especially in Basel and Zurich, that you are actively growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of GxP and computer system validation, and how they apply to data and AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in data and AI: you can discuss what an AI use case needs from data, what it costs and when it pays back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English. German is a strong advantage, French a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the Zurich area, with regular travel to Basel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape what comes next: the Swiss practice has proven itself and is growing fast. It is still small enough that you shape its clients, its offers and its team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell with a global platform: you bring the credentials, delivery capacity and AI assets of a 2,500-person firm into every proposal, and you work with industry leads across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy to production under one roof: our consultants and engineers work in the same teams, so your clients get from recommendation to working solution without changing firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture: innovation, collaboration and action shape how we work. Artefact Switzerland is Great Place to Work certified (2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: you are measured on the clients, revenue and team you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Creative Fabrica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Fabrica is a fast-growing AI platform that makes it easy for everyday consumers to create whatever they imagine, from images and videos to audio and 3D creations, using the latest generative AI models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You know that feeling when a new AI model drops and you can’t wait to create something with it? We want to make that excitement contagious. Every new model, tool and feature we launch is a chance to show people something they hadn’t imagined creating themselves. We want videos they immediately send to friends, ideas they can’t wait to try and people opening our tools because they HAVE to make something. That’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, in-office role at our Amsterdam HQ, with 30 work-from-anywhere days per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who LOVES generating videos with AI and knows how to turn a great idea into a video people can’t ignore. You’re already making AI movies, creating unexpected visual effects and refining your prompts until the result matches the idea in your head. You save videos for their brilliant execution and immediately start thinking about how you’d make something even better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll create and edit product-launch videos and original social videos designed to grab attention and get shared. Working with our launch team, you’ll turn product-marketing messages into creative concepts and storyboards, then generate the images and video sequences with AI. You’ll lead the creative direction and own the edit, obsessing over hooks, storytelling, pacing and sound just as much as the visuals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside a dedicated motion designer, combining the videos you generate with AI with their animation and compositing. From shaping the first idea to generating the right shots and editing the final cut, you’ll turn our products’ capabilities into videos that make people excited to try them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the creative direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn product-marketing messages into original concepts, hooks and storyboards. Own how we bring each launch to life, making people excited about what they can create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate videos with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Create images, video sequences and unexpected visual effects. Choose the right tools and refine your prompts and shots until the result matches your creative vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the edit:&lt;/strong&gt; Create product-launch videos and original social videos people can’t ignore. Bring everything together through strong storytelling, pacing, music and sound, giving people a reason to watch and share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead production:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the launch team and brief your dedicated motion designer, combining AI-generated videos with animation and compositing. Own the work from the first concept through revisions to the final cut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep pushing the creative:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring fresh ideas without waiting for a brief. Stay close to new AI capabilities and use audience response to sharpen your hooks, improve your videos and decide what to create next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A genuine obsession with AI video creation:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re already making AI movies, refining your techniques and getting your hands on new models and tools. You have work to show, not just an interest in the possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative direction and marketing instincts:&lt;/strong&gt; You can turn a product message into a compelling visual story. You understand the audience, know why they should care and develop the concept yourself rather than waiting for a storyboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent editing and visual judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Your portfolio demonstrates strong storytelling, hooks, pacing and sound. You know how to turn AI-generated shots into a complete video, not just a collection of impressive clips.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong social video instincts:&lt;/strong&gt; You save standout videos, study why they work and see opportunities to make something original. You understand what earns attention and gives people a reason to share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ideas through to finished videos, manage deadlines and communicate clearly with the launch team and motion designer, with excellent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating product-launch videos or social campaigns for AI, technology or creative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would also like to offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; On days you work in the office a warm fresh lunch will be provided for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days &lt;strong&gt;Work From Anywhere Benefit&lt;/strong&gt; per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24&lt;/strong&gt; days of paid vacation per year + public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Allowance&lt;/strong&gt;, if you live more than 10 KM from the office (in the form of an NS card).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;pension plan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;events&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;overseas trips&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-blocks&quot;&gt;
